# q-hover (h8-plane): the pointer resting at (1028, 490), plot (2, 0), off
# both handles: the Q ring on the curve at the quantized x=2, the full-height
# guide, both drop lines, the label "Q (2.00, 2.00)". A fresh page; the first
# move settles, then the final move lands on the fresh render (a 1 px nudge
# would leave Q at 2.02, as the first probe showed).
# Behaviour: url line (empty query); q line 2.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 1029 490
wait 800
move 1028 490
wait 500
shot q-hover
